{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52272","headline":"诗（幷序） 三十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 三十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"你若是好儿，孝心看父母。\n五更牀前立，即问安稳不。\n天明汝好心，钱财横入户。\n玉祥敬母恩，冬竹抽笋与。\n孝是韩伯[俞]（伦），董永孤养母。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}